# Backend inventory

**Skill:** `ai-copilots/skills/polypus-backend-inventory/SKILL.md` (MUST Read when this rule loads).

## MUST

- Fetch upstream model lists when `models.sync` is true (serve warmup, allow POST, refresh loop).
- Keep `models.allow` as the inference gate, not the sole inventory source while sync is on.
- Put list HTTP in `internal/clients/<extension>`; use `WithGeminiClientGet` (or equivalent) in gateway tests instead of loopback `base_url` on Gemini backends.

## MUST NOT

- Return only `syntheticModels(allow)` for a syncing extension (Gemini early return anti-pattern).
- Set Gemini chat `base_url` to Google for inventory; use the gemini catalog client list URL.
- Derive DeepInfra inventory as `{chat-base}/v1/models`; pin `GET {origin}/v1/openai/models`.
